{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00022","headline":"春日登陕州城楼俯眺原野回丹碧缀烟霞密翠斑红芳菲花柳即目川岫聊以命篇 · 太宗皇帝","name":"春日登陕州城楼俯眺原野回丹碧缀烟霞密翠斑红芳菲花柳即目川岫聊以命篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧原开雾隰，绮岭峻霞城。\n烟峰高下翠，日浪浅深明。\n斑红粧橤树，圆青压溜荆。\n迹岩劳傅想，窥野访莘情。\n巨川何以济，舟楫伫时英。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00022.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00022","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}